<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="1985f365">&lt;p&gt;
    Back-end and batch processes are the components of the application that are jobs that can run to completion without
    human interaction. All input parameters are predefined through scripts, command-line arguments, control files, or job
    control language. The required batch jobs should include processes and reporting in the system as required.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
